    </a></figure></p>
]]></description></item><item><title>Q525 连续数组（前缀和 + 哈希）</title><link>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/q525-%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%80%E5%92%8C%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>作者</name></author><guid>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/q525-%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%80%E5%92%8C%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="/q525-%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%80%E5%92%8C%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C/featured-image.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div><blockquote>
<p><strong>来源</strong>：本题是 LeetCode 525，前缀和 + 哈希表的典型应用。这篇是我从 Obsidian 笔记整理过来的第一篇博客文章。</p></blockquote>
<h2 id="一解题核心转化" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e4%b8%80%e8%a7%a3%e9%a2%98%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e8%bd%ac%e5%8c%96" class="header-mark"></a>1 一、解题核心转化</h2><h3 id="1-数值映射关键技巧" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#1-%e6%95%b0%e5%80%bc%e6%98%a0%e5%b0%84%e5%85%b3%e9%94%ae%e6%8a%80%e5%b7%a7" class="header-mark"></a>1.1 1. 数值映射（关键技巧）</h3><p><code>0 → -1，1 → 1</code></p>
<ul>
<li>子数组 <strong>0、1 数目相等</strong> ⇨ 子数组所有元素相加 = <code>0</code></li>
<li>问题转化：<strong>找最长区间和 = 0 的连续子数组</strong></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="2-前缀和公式" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#2-%e5%89%8d%e7%bc%80%e5%92%8c%e5%85%ac%e5%bc%8f" class="header-mark"></a>1.2 2. 前缀和公式</h3><p>$$preSum[r] - preSum[l] = 0 \iff preSum[r] = preSum[l]$$</p>
<ul>
<li>若两个位置前缀和相等：区间 $[l, r-1]$ 和为 0，满足题意</li>
<li>区间长度：$r - l$</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="二易错点vector-初始化大坑踩坑记录" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e4%ba%8c%e6%98%93%e9%94%99%e7%82%b9vector-%e5%88%9d%e5%a7%8b%e5%8c%96%e5%a4%a7%e5%9d%91%e8%b8%a9%e5%9d%91%e8%ae%b0%e5%bd%95" class="header-mark"></a>2 二、易错点：vector 初始化大坑（踩坑记录）</h2><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// ❌ 错误写法：{n+1,0} 是初始化列表，生成【两个元素：n+1、0】
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"></span><span class="n">vector</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="n">preSum</span><span class="p">{</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">};</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// ✅ 正确写法：(容量,初始值)，开辟 n+1 个空间全部赋值 0
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"></span><span class="n">vector</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="n">preSum</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><blockquote>
<p>报错原因：vector 实际只有 2 个元素，循环访问 <code>preSum[i+1]</code> 下标越界 → heap-buffer-overflow 堆溢出</p></blockquote>
<h2 id="三算法步骤" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e4%b8%89%e7%ae%97%e6%b3%95%e6%ad%a5%e9%aa%a4" class="header-mark"></a>3 三、算法步骤</h2><ol>
<li>构造前缀和数组：$preSum[0]=0，preSum[i]=preSum[i-1]+(nums[i-1]==0?-1:1)$</li>
<li>哈希表 <code>unordered_map&lt;前缀和, 首次下标&gt;</code>，<strong>预先存入：map[0]=0</strong>（处理从数组开头就满足条件的子数组）</li>
<li>遍历前缀和：
<ul>
<li>前缀和未出现：存入哈希（只存第一次下标，保证最长区间）</li>
<li>前缀和已存在：计算区间长度 <code>i - map[preSum[i]]</code>，更新最大值</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="四c-完整-ac-代码" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%9b%9bc-%e5%ae%8c%e6%95%b4-ac-%e4%bb%a3%e7%a0%81" class="header-mark"></a>4 四、C++ 完整 AC 代码</h2><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
